OL,3,GNEWSAUS rapper postpones O2 arena show
OL,4,Aafter Manchester evacuation
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person was taken to hospital and
OL,7,Fmore than 80 were assessed for "eye and
OL,8,Frespiratory symptoms" after the
OL,9,Fincident during Toliver's show at the
OL,10,FCo-op Live arena on Sunday night.
OL,12,FFans described "distressing scenes"
OL,13,Fwith people "choking", "screaming" and
OL,14,F"coughing up blood" because of the
OL,15,Feffects of an unknown substance, which
OL,16,Fpolice initially believed to be tear
OL,17,Fgas.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
